# Flux never reads these: they are run by hand / by dagger, not by a controller.
#   ./k3s        inventory, vars and runbook for the k3s install (Ansible)
#   ./terraform  Terraform roots for the on-node services (MinIO, OpenBao)
# kustomization.yaml already lists only the Flux objects; this keeps it that
# way even if that file goes.
k3s/
terraform/
#   ./cluster-apps.yaml  input of blueprints render-cluster-apps (ClusterApps),
#                no Kubernetes object
#   ./apps/openbao-prereqs  only the seal key's SOPS source for cluster-apps.yaml
#                (ref+sops); the bundle builds the seal Secret from openbao-sops-secrets
cluster-apps.yaml
apps/openbao-prereqs/
